{"text": "I killed him fairly, Tajamaru said. The wind lifted her face covering, and I wanted her. I promised him buried treasure and led him into the bushes. There I tied him to a cedar tree. She fought with her dagger. She held my arm and begged for one of us to die. She would leave with the man who lived. I freed him for a fair sword fight. Twenty-three blows. No other man had lasted twenty. She was gone when he fell. I took his weapons and left. I crawled towards my husband. Misago said at the temple. The bandit had left him tied up. I begged him to die with me. His cold eyes said I was nothing even though I was his wife. He moved his lips while I held my dagger. Kill me, he said. So I stabbed him. I could not stand those eyes. I later tried drowning myself, but I failed. Where can I go after that?", "words": [{"w": " I", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.54, "p": 0.308}, {"w": " killed", "start": 0.54, "end": 0.94, "p": 0.991}, {"w": " him", "start": 0.94, "end": 1.36, "p": 0.996}, {"w": " fairly,", "start": 1.36, "end": 2.08, "p": 0.914}, {"w": " Tajamaru", "start": 2.74, "end": 3.68, "p": 0.703}, {"w": " said.", "start": 3.68, "end": 4.12, "p": 0.996}, {"w": " The", "start": 5.1, "end": 5.36, "p": 0.856}, {"w": " wind", "start": 5.36, "end": 5.7, "p": 0.994}, {"w": " lifted", "start": 5.7, "end": 6.1, "p": 0.999}, {"w": " her", "start": 6.1, "end": 6.38, "p": 0.996}, {"w": " face", "start": 6.38, "end": 6.7, "p": 0.999}, {"w": " covering,", "start": 6.7, "end": 7.06, "p": 0.873}, {"w": " and", "start": 7.36, "end": 7.46, "p": 0.993}, {"w": " I", "start": 7.46, "end": 7.88, "p": 0.995}, {"w": " wanted", "start": 7.88, "end": 8.14, "p": 0.993}, {"w": " her.", "start": 8.14, "end": 8.52, "p": 0.999}, {"w": " I", "start": 8.84, "end": 9.16, "p": 0.996}, {"w": " promised", "start": 9.16, "end": 9.46, "p": 0.996}, {"w": " him", "start": 9.46, "end": 9.76, "p": 0.996}, {"w": " buried", "start": 9.76, "end": 10.12, "p": 0.997}, {"w": " treasure", "start": 10.12, "end": 10.6, "p